  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F.",
    "Lightly oil a 6-inch ramekin with olive oil.",
    "Arrange the sliced kielbasa in the bottom of the ramekin.",
    "Whisk together eggs, lactose-free milk, lactose-free cream cheese, cheddar, green onion tops, parsley, salt, and pepper until smooth.",
    "Pour the egg mixture over the sausage, filling the ramekin about three quarters full.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes or until the quiche is set and lightly golden on top.",
    "Remove from oven and let rest five minutes before serving."
